Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vol. com
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mushroomon and Floramon had become\Nslaves of the Digimon Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ninjimon got into a battle with Shurimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gekkomon was there to help us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we hid in the underground\Ncastle of Shogun Gekkomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ninjimon secretly\Nslipped in and put a dark
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spiral on Shogun Gekkomon\Nwhile he was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went berserk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't control him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we tricked him into destroying the\NDark Tower and then put him back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Working together, we removed the\NDark Spiral and returned home.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.68,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fscx115\fscy115\pos(319,361)}Submarimon - Escape from the Bottom of the Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Submarimon, let's get out of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Seedramon's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he knows it's\Nonly a matter of time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before our air supply\Nruns out down here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of being\Ndown here in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd give anything to be\Nout in the fresh air again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were all fine a\Nlittle while ago when we
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:03:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were tracking the signal\Nof a new digi-egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a strange place\Nto find a digi-egg, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but if the Digivice says\Nit's under an offshore oil platform,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the digi-egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the D3, we're\Nalmost right on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope it's waterproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm just wondering if the egg\Nbelongs to TK or perhaps Carter or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.79,0:03:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna go look for that digi-egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last one, there's a rotten digi-egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be careful. Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do\Nto those kids, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking over the world at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I have a lunch date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make a seed, Ramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my permission to\Ndo with them what you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning javelin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't really going\Nto hang up oil prices!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard of earthquakes\Nbefore, but never ocean quakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The room is flooding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found an emergency shutoff now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I classify this as an emergency,\Nso what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit the switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, the water can't get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if we could,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we'd just be bait because Mega\NSeedramon's still out there waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been so scared in my whole life
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna make it out alive, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so upset, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had this nightmare\Never since I was little
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dream was always the\Nsame I was trapped at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bottom of the ocean\NAnd I couldn't get out Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.72,0:05:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll find a way out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise It was just a dream\NBy the way, how did it end?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this doesn't look like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure looks real to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do believe it says it's an\Nemergency ejection vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out, sunshine, here we come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, it only holds one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, Cody\Nshould be the one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we all agree, right, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.64,0:05:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I agree, Cody's the one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's all settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.39,0:05:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Climb into the pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason you want me to\Ngo is because I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I won't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to face my fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to get out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I was given that chance, I'd\Nbe all over it like a cheap suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go because you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I can't tell which\None of them is the youngest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, I've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll draw straws and\Nwhoever wins gets to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds fair to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not good at drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That seems like a really\Ngood plan, Yoli. I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that sound to you, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother making any\Nstraws for me, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, to be fair, they\Nshould make straws for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we should all have an equal\Nchance to make it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One for all and all for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them has red on the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's let Cody go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, but why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, you're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you picked\Nthe straw on the first try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about beginner's luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Cody. So climb in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what'd you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the straws have red on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first one was so pretty,\NI just couldn't stop coloring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.99,0:07:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, but we had no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were being so stubborn about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they set the whole thing up\Nso Cody would feel like he had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that neither of\Nyou two were in on the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean everyone knew but us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still not going. Davis? TK? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me go. Put me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Cody, make sure you keep your arms\Nand legs inside the ride at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as you get back, find\NJoe and tell him what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikakumon's the only one who\Ncan get us out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.44,0:07:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.90,0:07:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mega Seedramon's not\Nwatching. Let's do it. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hold perfectly still.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I can't answer my\Ncell phone right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I had to turn it off so it\Nwouldn't ring during my biology test.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good at biology, so\NI'll turn it back on real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless the test is on molecular biology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.22,0:08:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I have to go study.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find Joe's school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Cody, you're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad, because I have some\Nerrands I want you to run for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, do you want to write it\Ndown, or will you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't. I'm kind of busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Cody, you can tell me what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I don't like you\Nkeeping secrets from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should not keep asking him about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's forced to tell you something,\Nhe might have to tell you a lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though that's not\Nwhat he wants to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better that he say nothing at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rather than say something\Nthat isn't the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing worse than\Ntelling a lie, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prune juice sure makes you smart, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon. Thanks, Grandpa
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have to keep banging your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.78,0:09:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're driving me crazy Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts just watching you. I'll\Nstop when you stop tapping your foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that? It's rather annoying. How\Nabout if I tap my foot on your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you two to be fighting\NWe're not Or arguing We're not Good,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, I'm glad that's settled
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, how about a nice game of checkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could use my shell as the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't feel\Nlike playing a game right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Armadillo Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but how can you be thinking of\Nplaying games at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, because I know Cody\Nwill come and rescue us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know Cody will try his best,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just don't know if\Nhe'll make it back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess is that we've only\Ngot a couple of hours left,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and shortly after that we'll\Ncompletely run out of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm sorry but he's taking a test right\Nnow but this is an emergency i need
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to see joe the rules say don't interrupt\Nanyone during the test now if there
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had been some kind of accident or\Nmaybe a member of his family was rushed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to a hospital or something like that it\Nwould be a different story Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And someone might have\Nto go to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing worse\Nthan lying. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.64,0:10:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., what are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the digi-egg is buried somewhere\Nin here, so I'm trying to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be more worried\Nabout trying to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just didn't feel like sitting\Naround here doing nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.38,0:11:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I figured at least\Nlet's find the digi-egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's help. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say, shall we? Sure! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dad's in the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Pa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I lied and said your dad was\Nsick, But I had to get you out of class.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad to know my dad's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, this is a real emergency\Nand you had no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but since your dad's all\Nright, why are you still running?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, I've got to\Nturn my phone back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize that, but I've got to tell Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For once in your life, get off\Nthe computer and answer the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Izzy, it's Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others are trapped under an offshore\Noil platform and they need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I want you to try to track\Ndown a very old friend of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that must mean it belongs to Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and that means that I'm the\None who gets to arm a Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of\NDigimon you're gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I have a pretty\Ngood idea. Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it'll be more like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of like a porcupine. I kind of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's the handsome one I don't get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how come everyone's laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just one of those times when you feel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you can't help but\Nlaugh. That's right. See,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.94,0:13:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone's so tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're pretending nothing's wrong\NLaughter's just a way to cover things up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, sort of like I\Ndo in the cat box How sad
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaliya, are you going to be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gokimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, everybody, a\NKakumon's here to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Gokimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's MegaSeadramon, my old foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an Ultimate level Digimon\Nwho destroys his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with his lightning javelin\Nand mega ice blast attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have faced him once before in Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't think I could defeat\Nhim unless I Digivolve to Zudomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aim for the Dark Spiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laymon's taxi service.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it'll be the perfect way\Nout of here, except for the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Cody! Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you Cody would come\Nthrough for us, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure did, and we never doubted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:14:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you get here, Whamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Tentomon told me our friends\Nwere in trouble, I set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.62,0:15:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple pounds. Hey, Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.74,0:15:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your digi-egg. It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that digi-egg has the\Ncrest of reliability on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crest of reliability\Nis perfect for Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't agree with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you ask me, I\Nthink it's a perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come down here and get it! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of that digi-egg that all of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us were trapped down\Nhere in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.94,0:15:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to have\Nanything to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will as soon as you come\Ndown here and get this digi-egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you that I don't want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we didn't come all the\Nway down here and go
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through all of this just\Nso you can say thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.28,0:15:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Cody, pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard what Joe said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know unless\Nyou try, so go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm the one who caused\Nthis mess, so it can't be my digi-egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, besides, we all wanted to\Nfind the Digi-Egg, not just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's nobody's fault, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I also told a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandfather said the worst\Nthing you could do is tell a lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's just what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve the\NDigi-Egg of reliability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's two kinds of lies, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.78,0:16:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are lies that are wrong, and then\Nthere are the lies that are acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, some lies can hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, some can actually help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like there's good\NDigimon and bad Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we get back, I'll explain the\Nwhole situation to your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell him that I\Nwasn't hurt by your lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, if you didn't lie,\Nwe might not have made it here in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.82,0:17:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your lie not only helped people,\Nbut actually saved their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, do we have a deal? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Cody, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.61,0:17:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you it was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Partner, I'm ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimental Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadilloman, I'm a Digivolve to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armour, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.40,0:17:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon,\Nare the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Submarimon, guardian of the sea ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, so much for my\Nidea of the porcupine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, a submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Submarimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:18:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I digivolve using the\Ndigi-egg of reliability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My oxygen torpedo attack makes\Nmy enemies truly seasick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Cody. Hop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have to face this sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Submarine attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you all right yeah now let's\Ntake care of this worm together
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll get him to follow me\Nyou sneak up on him Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't really matter\Nwho you are. You might as
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well be a superstar I'm a\Nvery overgrown garden snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oxygen Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.24,0:19:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting harder to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,win Now for the Dark Spiral
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, you did it! Well, he\Nshould be back to normal now. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.06,0:19:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,job submarine on thanks couldn't\Nhave done it without you they've
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been down there a long time don't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worry we can
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,count on cody way
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to go they destroyed the dark spiral\Nlet's hear it for cody hip hip
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Digi-Destin\Nmanaged to get away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to\Ndo about it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.03,0:19:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not mad? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.76,0:19:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not like you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually you would have smashed\Nsomething by now, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:20:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all part of that secret plan\Nyou've been talking about, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon, it's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.78,0:20:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well i guess we should\Nget back to the others
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now what you hurry i want\Nto show you something
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.56,0:20:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is it i think you\Nwere afraid of the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because it was something\Nyou never had the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to see and experience it\Nfor yourself it's true
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that some things about\Nthe ocean are dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.78,0:20:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there are things\Ndown here that are more
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beautiful than you could\Never imagine Look up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cody. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, you and I can\Nlearn a lot about the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.04,0:20:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I don't have to be afraid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the secret plan\Nof the Digimon Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will it finally destroy the Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.28,0:21:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out on the next\NDigimon Digital Monsters!
